=============================================================
  Vector Error Correction Model
=============================================================

  Gamma(L) (nabla Y_t - delta) = alpha (beta'Y_{t-1} - E[W]) + Theta(L) A_t
  Gamma(L) = I - Gamma_1 L - ...,  Theta(L) = I - Theta1 L - ... - Theta_q L^q,   Pi = alpha beta'
  delta = E[nabla Y], the drift: E[nabla Y2] on the Y2 block, -beta_2' E[nabla Y2] on Y1

